ILPHOTX SHOP — MERCHANT DASHBOARD
Tugiye gutegura Merchant Dashboard mu buryo bwa professional Multi-Vendor E-commerce Marketplace, dukoresheje:
- Next.js (App Router)
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma ORM
- Redis
Merchant ni umucuruzi wemejwe na Super Admin cyangwa Admin. Azajya agira shop ye bwite muri ILPHOTX SHOP, ashyiremo ibicuruzwa, acunge orders, abone amafaranga yinjije, acunge abakozi be, kandi akurikirane uko abakiriya basura shop ye.

Itegeko rikomeye: Merchant azajya abona amakuru ajyanye na shop ye gusa. Ntabwo azajya abona ibicuruzwa, orders, staff cyangwa amafaranga by'abandi merchants.
