Kubera ko dukoresha PostgreSQL na Prisma, tugomba kubaka uburyo buri merchant agira amakuru ye bwite.

Dore models z'ingenzi:
Prisma Model	Icyo izajya ibika
User	Abakoresha
MerchantProfile	Amakuru y'umucuruzi
Shop	Shop y'umucuruzi
MerchantStaff	Abakozi
Role	Roles
Permission	Permissions
StaffInvitation	Invitations
Product	Ibicuruzwa
ProductImage	Amafoto
Category	Categories
Inventory	Stock
StockMovement	Stock history
ProductView	Product views
Order	Orders
OrderItem	Ibicuruzwa biri muri order
Payment	Payments
MerchantEarning	Amafaranga merchant agomba guhabwa
