Multi-tenant security
Buri product, order, inventory record, staff record na financial record igomba kugira shopId cyangwa indi ownership reference ikwiye.

Urugero:
const products = await prisma.product.findMany({
  where: {
    shopId: authenticatedUser.shopId
  }
});


Ntituzemera ko shopId itangwa n'uko user yanditse muri frontend ngo ni yo yonyine igenzura access. Backend izajya iyikura muri authenticated session kandi igenzure ownership kuri buri request.
Redis ikoreshwa he?
Redis Feature	Uko izafasha
Dashboard Cache	Kwihutisha dashboard
Product Cache	Kwihutisha products
Session Cache	Gucunga sessions
Notification Queue	Kohereza notifications
BullMQ Jobs	Scheduled publishing
Rate Limiting	Kurinda API abuse
Real-time Events	Notifications na chat

Ntabwo tuzabika permanent sales, payments cyangwa audit logs muri Redis gusa.
