Merchant Dashboard — Final Architecture
Recommended structure
Main Sidebar: 15 navigation sections zirimo Dashboard, Shop, Products, Orders, Inventory, Payments, Analytics, Marketing, Customers, Staff, Messages, Audit Logs, Profile, Settings na Support.

Sub-sidebar: Buri module igira submenu zayo.

Access Control: Owner, custom roles na staff permissions.

Database: Buri merchant agira shopId, amakuru ye akagenzurwa kuri backend.

Performance: Redis caching, PostgreSQL indexing na pagination.

Security: Audit Logs, 2FA, secure invitations na payment protection.

Inama yanjye: Merchant Dashboard tuyubake ku buryo umucuruzi abasha gucunga ubucuruzi bwe bwose atavuye muri ILPHOTX SHOP: gushyiraho products, kwakira orders, gucunga staff, gukurikirana amafaranga no kuvugana n'abakiriya.

